        <div id=\"r_18098847\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_normal.png?m=1785201732\" alt=\"ShiBuYi\" data-uid=\"604449\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ShiBuYi\">ShiBuYi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 09:50:00 +08:00\">20h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前本来也不在意啊，不一直都这样。<br>老板想的是，怎样才省钱，性价比才是第一。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099053\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0bda341e67a9e7e4b981427cb0ce2796?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"purringpal\" data-uid=\"644567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/purringpal\">purringpal</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 10:17:00 +08:00\">20h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有实力有资源的公司，核心项目用原生实现一直都是最优解。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099254\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/824f12cd60fa42902091388bc0820aad?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"forbreak\" data-uid=\"82516\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/forbreak\">forbreak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 10:44:05 +08:00\">19h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>本来就应该是这样啊，解决问题才是重要的。 什么语言什么框架解决了问题就是好，解决不了问题就是垃圾。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099318\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9d9a/d0e1/429073_normal.png?m=1683186278\" alt=\"alleluya\" data-uid=\"429073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alleluya\">alleluya</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 10:51:54 +08:00\">19h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Shopify 不就是老板脑袋一拍 说要转啥就转啥么 RN 支了一摊子就不管了 到时候 AI 这一摊子一样的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099452\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:10:11 +08:00\">19h 9m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>神特么 Spotify ，看得我一头雾水，仔细一看图里的截图：Shopify</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099473\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a840/0474/680790_normal.png?m=1740469390\" alt=\"Sayonaracc\" data-uid=\"680790\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sayonaracc\">Sayonaracc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:13:33 +08:00\">19h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>然而我们开始让一群不懂移动端的人让 ai 用 flutter 重构 c 端的 app ，也算是反着来了[doge]</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099524\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6002/b4c1/487287_normal.png?m=1773624099\" alt=\"JYii\" data-uid=\"487287\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JYii\">JYii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:22:48 +08:00\">18h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>搬文章你给我搬好的啊（焯</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099694\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ad6e/1c7e/379646_normal.png?m=1607064358\" alt=\"CallMeSoul\" data-uid=\"379646\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CallMeSoul\">CallMeSoul</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:48:35 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>我觉的也不是吧</p><p>主要看成本和性能<br>1.没 AI 之前，过多的追求性能（原生开发）成本高得不是两倍吧，所以肯定就跨平台方案<br>2.有 AI 后，过多的追求性能（原生开发）成本降低了，在 Spotify 能接受的范围内了，所以 Spotify 选了原生了<br>3.有 AI 后两套方案的成本还是不一样的（只是说总体都降了，但是还是有高低差得）。如果一公司不赚钱也没啥钱，你肯定还是跨平台方案用更少的 token 啊。如果为了追求性能，只支付两套 TOKEN 的价格的就选原生吧。看取舍</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099826\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td>